{
  "version": 1,
  "style": "anime",
  "note": "T-AVT-06a. The Anime style's own full part set, on the same canvas and anchors as the illustrated kit (parts.json). Categories marked shared are the same choice in both styles (kept when the style is switched): skin, hair_colour, outfit_colour (clothing_colour), glasses, head_covering, background. status: placeholder | final. Anime parts are never drawn in code: until final or licensed placeholder art exists (T-AVT-06c, docs/design/asset-licences.md), the app shows a soft circle with the coach's initial. Expression and mouth versions per part come with T-AVT-06b.",
